<title>USA: Champion sets record date for meeting.</title>
<headline>Champion sets record date for meeting.</headline>
<dateline>AUBURN HILLS, Mich. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Champion Enterprises Inc said it set September 23 as the record date for a special meeting of shareholders to be held October 24.</p>
<p>At the meeting, shareholders will be asked to approve issuance of shares under a merger agreement with Redman Industries Inc, Champion said.</p>
<p>In the merger, 1.24 Champion shares will be issued for each Redman share, it said.</p>
<p>Champion expects to distribute proxy materials for the special meeting shortly after the record date, it said.</p>
<p>Both companies are in the manufactured home business.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
